# AES-128 (FIPS-197), byte-oriented over a flat 16-byte column-major block (state[4*column + row]). The
# S-box, its inverse and the rnd constants are carried as the spec tables. `aes-encrypt-block` and
# `aes-decrypt-block` are the single-block cipher and inverse cipher over a 16-byte key: one block, no mode,
# no padding (a mode composes on top). Held to the FIPS-197 appendix C.1 vector in deck/seed/test/aes.tree
# (00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff under 000102...0f -> 69c4e0d86a7b0430d8cdb78070b4c55a).
load @term/seed/code/bit
  find bitwise-and
  find bitwise-exclusive-or
  find shift-left
  find unsigned-shift-right

